      "content": "1. 839                                          CASTLE STREET                                              (East Side)                                              No 57 (The Boote) SP  9907 NW 1/118 II 2.  Date 1605 on front.  Stucco ground floor, timber frame and plaster 1st floor, Welsh slated roof.  2 storeys, 3 1st floor casements with glazing bars.  4 ground floor canted bay windows under continuous frieze and cornice; glazing bars to bay on left. Listing NGR: SP9947607989"
